なんでか\n涙腺崩壊してしまいました。わーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンビニの時の弁当の袋って\nなんで茶色なんですかね(^_^;)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それ知ってる！！\nきっとお弁当温めたんだね。\n温かいものは茶色なんだよ。\n茶色は保温性がいいんだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さーすがまりっか！\nこんな物知りまりっかを\nほめてください。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はまってるお菓子ある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にこまるクッキー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美容室でイメージどうりに\nいかなかった時ある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるよー。\n私は説明が下手くそで\n伝わらなかったんだよ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひげ生やすのどう思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合ってれば良いと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近まりっか丸顔じゃなくて\nシュッてしてない？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え。本当ですか！\nでも食べ物とか気を使うように\nなったし、マッサージも\nしてるからかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスプレゼントの中で\n１番思い出に残ってるプレゼント\nってありますか？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃい頃ね。\nクリスマスイブに親とケンカしたの。\nで、もうサンタさんから何も\nもらえないだろう...\nって思ってたんだけど、\n翌日、欲しかったDSと動物の森が\n机の上に置いてあって...\n感動してました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校での髪型は下ろしてる？\nそれとも結んでる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴっちり結んでるよ～\nというか結ばないとダメなのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会って今からでも入れるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というかめっちゃ嬉しい！\n嬉し過ぎてエアギター"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会...\n伊藤万理華を推してくださる方\n(単推しに限らず)が\n入会することができる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会のみなさん、\nゆるくてまじめで最高です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも1人で洋服買いに行く？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達と買い物行っても\n趣味が合わなかったら結局\n別行動しちゃうんですよ。\nだから一人で行くことの方が\n多いかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログに写真載せてくれるけど\n写真によって全然印象が違って\n観える...意識して撮ってる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい！\nいろんな表情できた方がいいし、\n見るのも楽しいですよね。\n研究してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何歳くらいから目悪くなった？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小6らへんかな。\n少しぼやけるくらいだったけど、\nメガネに憧れてすぐ作った←\n今は両目の視力が全然違う\n右目全く見えん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作ったクッキーを自己採点すると\n100点満点で何点？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"75点！\n普通に美味だったと思うんですけど\nなんかアレンジとかできるように\nなりたいです。\n家族から好評でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スマホの電池対策は何かしてる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐ無くなるから電池で\n充電できるのも持ち歩いてるよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、センター試験\nやっと私の問題きたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え、これかよ...とか\n...地味！とかとか！\n思ってないでしょうねえ？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単でしょっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあーここでも問題出そうかな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q1:動画で、ちょいちょい聞こえる声。\nそれは誰の声でしょう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q2:この写真。私の後ろでぶれちゃった\nメンバーは誰でしょう？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真のは簡単だね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/3460475/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はついに\n4thシングル「制服のマネキン」\nの発売日！やったー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もさっそくCD入れて聞いてるよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日リハがんばろーう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-45357":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日、TGCに出演させて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またこうしてランウェイを歩けて幸せでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はREDYAZELのステージに👗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3ZQCVK3EWK7JEZDVDND43T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3ZQDW65RSD68FZQ5V77QKF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3ZQEW2KQNCND3R7YE91J33","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いコート。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さん、配信を見てくださった皆さんもありがとうございました☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#待ってる時が1番緊張するよね\n#ほのちゃんとるんるんと近かった\n#後ろの高橋ひかるちゃんともお話してました😊"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-20452":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" こんばんは\n \n ひらがなけやきの加藤史帆です⊂((・x・))⊃\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYADHQR9MCKDATF7KVWCN4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 私の最近の悩み。。。\n \n それは髪色がすぐ落ちて明るくなってしまうことです！！！\n \n せっかくお気に入りの髪色にしてもらっても1週間以内には色落ちします(  ˙-˙ ; )\n \n しかも私の髪の毛は細くて絡まりやすいし傷みやすくて、毛先をこまめに切らないといけないんです！！\n \n 私すっっごく長い髪の毛に昔から憧れてるんですけど、オーディションの時からずーーっと長さ変わってません（笑）\n \n なので！年内までには胸下くらいの長さになることを目標にして頑張ります(｡･о･｡)\n はやく髪の毛を伸ばす方法とか調べてみようっと！\n よし！頑張るぞおお！！！\n \n 皆さん良いシャンプーとかヘアオイルとかご存知でしたら是非教えて下さい(｡･_･｡)ﾉ♡♡\n \n \n \n 最後に、、わたしネガティ部、、退部するかもしれません、、、（笑）\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYAEJDZ6YQEXYDTS2SPA1Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n おやすみなさい(｡･ω･)ﾉ♪︎\n \n \n お読みいただきありがとうございました。\n \n 加藤史帆"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-s46-61346":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202508/mob7XrDAA.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202508/mobaIvwPW.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202508/mobifbUOu.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202508/mobQHHXft.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会えた日と話せた日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202508/mobSeA2zD.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202508/mobfgviJw.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202508/mobwsnjpq.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202508/mobMuSMKx.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202508/mobtA4zqT.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも思っていてくれてありがとう〜*\nとっても届いています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつだってもらってばかりな気持ちです、、\n私に優しくしてくれるみたいに自分にも優しくしてね୨୧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も優しくしてもらったみたいに\n誰かに優しくする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202508/mobmluz3t.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202508/mobjxFfWz.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202508/mobJgqL8h.jpg","alt":""}],"source":"official"},"ofc-hina-44921":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京都出身 18歳 髙橋未来虹です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式サイトから発表がありました通り、PCR検査を行ったところ陽性反応が出てしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事の関係者の皆様、ファンの皆様に多大なるご迷惑をおかけしてしまい大変申し訳ございません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日・明後日のミート＆グリートも、私自身とても楽しみにしていたので、悔しさでいっぱいです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブが終わってからも気をつけて生活していたため、2度目の感染に自分が一番驚いています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"症状は軽症ですが、油断せず、今は療養に専念したいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月はライブに向けて駆け抜けてきたので、今はゆっくり過ごそうかな😌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い日が続きますので、皆さんも体調にはお気をつけください。こまめな水分補給も忘れずに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまでです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくださってありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髙橋未来虹"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-hina-52332":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神奈川県出身 17歳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮地すみれ(みやちすみれ)です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを開いてくださり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます‪( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は先日終わりを迎えた10thシングル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別ミート&グリートのお話を……"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リアミのお話はまた次回のブログで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書かせていただきますね(  . .)\"‬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph",